SUMMARY:Skyliners BIg Band Dance
LOCATION:PC53 - Petroleum Club of Lafayette\, 111 Heymann Blvd\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:The Skyliners Big Band Dance\nJoin us for our last dance of the
  season in our 76th year\, on Friday\, December 4\, 2026\, from 7:00 to 10
  PM at The Petroleum Club.\nGet ready to dance and listen to our fabulous 
 18-piece big band\, featuring vocalists Billie Castle and Bill Roza\, in a
 n elegant ballroom!\nYou do not need to be a member of The Petroleum Club 
 of Lafayette or our dance club to attend.\nIf you have not purchased membe
 rship to our dance club\, admission is $20 at the door\, $10 for students.
 \nFood and drinks are available for sale at our dance events.\nThis is ele
 gant ballroom dancing at its finest! Please honor our dress code\, which i
 s cocktail attire to formal. (No jeans\, please.)\nGrab your dancing shoes
 \, friends! We can't wait to see you there!\nYour membership and attendanc
 e help to keep this treasured big band going!\n\nhttps://happeningnext.com
 /event/skyliners-big-band-dance-eid3a0eae2iao
